{{Documentation}}
<templatestyles src="Template:GachaDescription/styles.css" />
This template is used to display lists of Super Rare and Rare Cats on gacha pages. It takes a list of units and outputs the resulting partial table format for the section, and it also has preset outputs from keywords passed to the <code>set</code> parameter: <code>super rare</code> for the normal Super Rare Cats, <code>super rare+</code> for the Super Rare Cats and the Grandon series, and <code>rare</code> for the normal Rare Cats.

==Examples==
<tabber>
Using Lists=
<pre>
{| cellpadding="0" cellspacing="4" style="width: 100%;"
| style="width: 100%; background-color: var(--gacha-rarity-sr); padding: 2px 0 2px 4px; font-weight: bold;" | ▼Super Rare
|-
{{GachaList|Hip Hop Cat|Vaulter Cat|Cat Toaster}}
|-
| style="width: 100%; background-color: var(--gacha-rarity-rr); padding: 2px 0 2px 4px; font-weight: bold;" | ▼Rare
|-
{{GachaList|Salon Cat|Tin Cat|Wushu Cat}}
|}
</pre>

===Result===
{| cellpadding="0" cellspacing="4" style="width: 100%;"
| style="width: 100%; background-color: var(--gacha-rarity-sr); padding: 2px 0 2px 4px; font-weight: bold;" | ▼Super Rare
|-
{{GachaList|Hip Hop Cat|Vaulter Cat|Cat Toaster}}
|-
| style="width: 100%; background-color: var(--gacha-rarity-rr); padding: 2px 0 2px 4px; font-weight: bold;" | ▼Rare
|-
{{GachaList|Salon Cat|Tin Cat|Wushu Cat}}
|}

|-|Preset Lists=
<pre>
{| cellpadding="0" cellspacing="4" style="width: 100%;"
| style="width: 100%; background-color: var(--gacha-rarity-sr); padding: 2px 0 2px 4px; font-weight: bold;" | ▼Super Rare
|-
{{GachaList|set=super rare+}}
|-
| style="width: 100%; background-color: var(--gacha-rarity-rr); padding: 2px 0 2px 4px; font-weight: bold;" | ▼Rare
|-
{{GachaList|set=rare}}
|}
</pre>

